      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Encoder / bottleneck main path:\nConv3D (3x3x3, stride s) -> BN -> PReLU\n-> Conv3D (3x3x3, stride 1) -> BN -> PReLU\nAdd a projected shortcut to this main path.\nDecoder: ConvTranspose3D (3x3x3, stride 2)\n-> BN -> PReLU -> one-convolution residual unit.",
      "originalText": "Encoder / bottleneck main path:\nConv3D (3x3x3, stride s) -> BN -> PReLU\n-> Conv3D (3x3x3, stride 1) -> BN -> PReLU\nAdd a projected shortcut to this main path.\nDecoder: ConvTranspose3D (3x3x3, stride 2)\n-> BN -> PReLU -> one-convolution residual unit.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
    },
