      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Input shape                  Deepest spatial grid\n64 x 64 x 64                 4 x 4 x 4\n64 x 64 x 32                 4 x 4 x 2\n48 x 48 x 32                 3 x 3 x 2\n32 x 32 x 32                 2 x 2 x 2\nUse multiples of 16 on every axis.",
      "originalText": "Input shape                  Deepest spatial grid\n64 x 64 x 64                 4 x 4 x 4\n64 x 64 x 32                 4 x 4 x 2\n48 x 48 x 32                 3 x 3 x 2\n32 x 32 x 32                 2 x 2 x 2\nUse multiples of 16 on every axis.",
